    "repair_quota": "Exactly first+one shared follow-up per game; second failures report shared_repair_quota_exhausted. No real-mismatch repair call or third request exists.",
    "time_accounting": "Use the sum of each distinct program_recomputed elapsed_seconds or final cumulative extra_seconds_used per game, not both. ft09 31.99723118999964 seconds; su15 39.50630926099984 seconds; sum across concurrent games71.50354045099948 seconds is not additional wall duration."
